id: explosion-sorcery
name: Explosion Sorcery
uaType: magical
prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in Use Magic
tpCost: 20
type: standard
# "Variable (1~3 Actions)" at "6(T) for each Action spent".
actionCost: 1
actionCostMax: 3
kiCostPerTier: 6
kiPerAction: true
# "Target a Character for each Action spent" - the ones targeted, no more than the Actions; a Clash (Cognitive vs
# Cognitive/Impulsive/Corporeal) each (chat.mjs postExplosion).
explodes: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A Clash (Cognitive vs Cognitive/Impulsive/Corporeal) at a Character for each Action spent: won, they lose Life Points
  equal to your Magic Modifier - a Minion is Defeated.
text: >
  Explosion Sorcery: Using your magical prowess, you cause another person to explode.
  –Ability Type: Magical
  –Prerequisites: 2+ Skill Ranks in Use Magic
  –TP Cost: 20
  –KP Cost: 6(T) for each Action spent
  –Maneuver Type: Standard
  –Action Cost: Variable (1~3 Actions)
  –Minions: Non-Minion
  –Passive Bonus: N/A
  –Effect: Target a Character for each Action spent on this Maneuver. Make a Clash (Cognitive vs
  Cognitive/Impulsive/Corporeal) against that Character. If you win, reduce that Character’s Life Points by your Magic
  Modifier. If that Character was a Minion (except a Special Minion), they are Defeated instead.
